    },
    "Put New Items in Hidden" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将新项放入“隐藏”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Put New Items in Shown" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将新项放入“显示”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reading…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在读取…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reveals hidden and always-hidden items while you arrange, until you turn this off or Rolltop hides them again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "整理时显示隐藏和始终隐藏的项，直到你关闭此选项或 Rolltop 再次将其隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rolltop" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rolltop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rolltop can list the apps you turned off in System Settings › Menu Bar once you allow it to read that list." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "允许 Rolltop 读取该列表后，它就能列出你在“系统设置 › 菜单栏”中关闭的 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rolltop can’t move this item. Hold ⌘ and drag it in the menu bar instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rolltop 无法移动此项。请改为在菜单栏中按住 ⌘ 拖移它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rolltop can’t read this app’s items right now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rolltop 目前无法读取此 App 的项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rolltop couldn’t keep access to the file you chose." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rolltop 无法保留对你所选文件的访问权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rolltop couldn’t read the file even after you chose it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "即使你选取了该文件，Rolltop 仍无法读取它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rolltop couldn’t read the list of apps turned off in System Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rolltop 无法读取在“系统设置”中关闭的 App 列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rolltop doesn’t recognize how this version of macOS stores that list." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rolltop 无法识别此版本 macOS 存储该列表的方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rolltop needs Device Control and Data Access to open menu bar items." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rolltop 需要“设备控制和数据访问”权限才能打开菜单栏项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rolltop needs Device Control and Data Access to see the items in your menu bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rolltop 需要“设备控制和数据访问”权限才能看到菜单栏中的项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Runs outside the Applications folder, so macOS hides it whenever Rolltop hides anything, whatever its section." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此 App 在“应用程序”文件夹之外运行，因此只要 Rolltop 隐藏任何项，macOS 就会隐藏它，无论它在哪个分区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saved in %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已存储于“%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Section" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "分区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Section for new items" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新项所在分区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shortcuts…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快捷键…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show Now" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "立即显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show hidden items in the menu bar" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在菜单栏中显示隐藏项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shown in the Rolltop Bar when you click Rolltop’s icon in the menu bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点按菜单栏中的 Rolltop 图标时，显示在 Rolltop 栏中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shown only when you Option-click Rolltop’s icon." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅在按住 Option 键点按 Rolltop 图标时显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shown when you Option-click Rolltop’s icon, and behind the disclosure in the Rolltop Bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按住 Option 键点按 Rolltop 图标时显示，也会折叠显示在 Rolltop 栏中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shown when you click Rolltop’s icon in the menu bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点按菜单栏中的 Rolltop 图标时显示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stays in the menu bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留在菜单栏中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System item" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That isn’t “%@”. Choose that file in the folder the panel opens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这不是“%@”。请在面板打开的文件夹中选取该文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app isn’t running." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该 App 未在运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The item didn’t appear in the menu bar in time. If it’s in the overflow menu, make room for it first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该项未能及时出现在菜单栏中。如果它在溢出菜单中，请先为它腾出空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new order takes effect the next time the menu bar changes, because Rolltop’s icon is hidden." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由于 Rolltop 的图标已隐藏，新顺序将在菜单栏下次变化时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The order of icons is set in the menu bar itself: hold ⌘ and drag an icon. Rolltop can’t change it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图标顺序在菜单栏中设置：按住 ⌘ 拖移图标即可。Rolltop 无法更改顺序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These items don’t belong to an app Rolltop can identify, so macOS hides them whenever Rolltop hides any item." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些项不属于 Rolltop 能识别的 App，因此只要 Rolltop 隐藏任何项，macOS 就会隐藏它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These keep their section for the next time they open. Forget one and it follows the section for new items instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些项会保留所在分区，以便下次打开时使用。忘记某一项后，它会改为遵循新项所在分区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To reorder items here, allow Rolltop to change the menu bar order." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要在这里调整项的顺序，请允许 Rolltop 更改菜单栏顺序。"
