    },
    "What macOS 27 doesn’t allow" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 27 不允许的操作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While Rolltop hides anything, macOS also hides the items it manages itself, such as AirDrop, Focus and Now Playing. They come back when nothing is hidden." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只要 Rolltop 隐藏了任何项，macOS 也会隐藏它自己管理的项，例如隔空投送、专注模式和“播放中”。没有项被隐藏时，它们会重新出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "items, icons, sections, shown, hidden, always hidden, apps, layout, arrange, drag, new items" : {
      "comment" : "Settings search keywords, comma separated",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
