            "value" : "只要 Rolltop 隐藏任何项，macOS 就会隐藏从“应用程序”文件夹之外运行的 App，无论它们在哪个分区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS hides these whenever Rolltop hides any item, and brings them back once nothing is hidden. Rolltop can’t keep them visible." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只要 Rolltop 隐藏任何项，macOS 就会隐藏这些项，直到没有项被隐藏时才恢复。Rolltop 无法让它们保持可见。"
